cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ndscape: nested dichotomy tree-space embedding"
abstract: >
  Code for scoring nested-dichotomy (ND) tree structures on
  multiclass datasets, embedding the tree space via metric MDS, and running
  a bias-variance simulation over the space.
